# Filament publishes its compiled CSS/JS/fonts into public/ and republishes
# them from `filament:upgrade` on every composer install, so they are build
# output, not source. ~4MB of vendor assets that would otherwise be committed
# and re-committed on every Filament bump.
/public/css/filament
/public/js/filament
/public/fonts/filament
